It is possible.  Read the spoiler if you don't want to 
discover it the hard way:




















































Identify your gems.  Some gems are valuable, some are just glass.  If the
shopkeeper see that you aren't sure what kind of gem you have, then he'll
pay as if they are glass and sell as if they are valuable.
But if you are sure that it as a diamond or something, then he will use
correct prices.  The gems will still be somewhat more expensive when you
buy than when you sell.



